## 📄 css/events.css — كامل معدّل

افتح `css/events.css` → ✏️ Edit → Ctrl+A → Delete → الصق ده:

```css
/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   Events Management Styles
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════ */

.events-container {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  width: 100%;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

/* ═══ Header ═══ */
.events-header {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.events-filters {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
  overflow-x: auto;
  padding: 4px 8px 10px 8px;
  margin: 0 -8px;
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
  scroll-padding: 8px;
  scroll-snap-type: x proximity;
  position: relative;
}

.events-filters::-webkit-scrollbar {
  height: 4px;
}

.events-filters::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
  background: var(--border);
  border-radius: 2px;
}

.events-filters::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
  background: transparent;
}

.filter-btn {
  padding: 8px 16px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--card-bg);
  color: var(--text-muted);
  border-radius: 20px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-family: inherit;
  white-space: nowrap;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  scroll-snap-align: start;
}

.filter-btn:hover {
  border-color: var(--primary);
  color: var(--primary);
}

.filter-btn.active {
  background: var(--primary);
  color: #fff;
  border-color: var(--primary);
}

/* ═══ Stats ═══ */
.events-stats {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.event-stat {
  background: var(--card-bg);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 16px;
  text-align: center;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4px;
}

.event-stat-value {
  font-size: 24px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--primary);
}

.event-stat-label {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

/* ═══ Grid ═══ */
.events-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(280px, 100%), 1fr));
  gap: 16px;
}

/* ═══ Card ═══ */
.event-card {
  background: var(--card-bg);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 14px;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  min-width: 0;
  width: 100%;
}

.event-card:hover {
