```javascript
const el = document.querySelector('.events-filters');
console.log('scrollWidth:', el.scrollWidth);
console.log('clientWidth:', el.clientWidth);
console.log('offsetWidth:', el.offsetWidth);
console.log('computed overflow-x:', getComputedStyle(el).overflowX);
console.log('computed width:', getComputedStyle(el).width);
console.log('computed touch-action:', getComputedStyle(el).touchAction);
```

**المتوقع:**
- `scrollWidth > clientWidth` ← يعني فيه scroll
- `computed overflow-x: auto` ✅
- `computed touch-action: pan-x` ✅

